     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PLS01                     TEXT('REINSURANCE LOSS REPORT')
     A            LSCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            LSFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            LSFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
